[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2643.109, "timestamp": "00:44:03", "text": "等等，小睡一会儿，不太像火山，活跃的火山"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2647.349, "timestamp": "00:44:07", "text": "哦，摧毁前哨站的自动化装置，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2648.87, "timestamp": "00:44:08", "text": "我认为现在更容易了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2652.23, "timestamp": "00:44:12", "text": "了解发生了什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2655.99, "timestamp": "00:44:15", "text": "糟糕，这里有个绿巨人！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2658.47, "timestamp": "00:44:18", "text": "你说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.109, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "该死，这东西对它一点作用都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2691.91, "timestamp": "00:44:51", "text": "我觉得我必须向绿巨人开枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2694.79, "timestamp": "00:44:54", "text": "哦，黄蜂，或者黄蜂不做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.79, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "对绿巨人来说，什么都行。呃，不，是……"}]